<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1906001068"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1801465189"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="LEVEL"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="やなぎなぎ / THE SIXTH LIE"/><amll:meta key="album" value="LEVEL"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:55.426"><div begin="00:02.508" end="03:56.326"><p begin="00:02.508" end="00:04.982" itunes:key="L29738">共鳴する日々重ねて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">互相共鸣的日夜不断交叠</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kyo u me i su ru hi bi ka sa ne te</span></p><p begin="00:04.992" end="00:07.734" itunes:key="L29739">降り積もった関係に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你我的关系愈加深厚</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ri tsu mo 't ta ka n ke i ni</span></p><p begin="00:07.744" end="00:12.641" itunes:key="L29740">ふさわしい名前を探すけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我尝试为它找个名字</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu sa wa shi i na ma e wo sa ga su ke do</span></p><p begin="00:13.199" end="00:15.876" itunes:key="L29741">「絆」だけでは軽くて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">单纯的“情谊”已显得单薄</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 ki zu na 」 da ke de wa ka ru ku te</span></p><p begin="00:15.886" end="00:18.755" itunes:key="L29742">支えられやしないだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">根本不可能支撑得住</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa sa e ra re ya shi na i da ro u</span></p><p begin="00:18.765" end="00:23.319" itunes:key="L29743">無尽蔵に膨らむ気持ちは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我无限鼓胀起的感情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu ji n zo u ni fu ku ra mu ki mo chi wa</span></p><p begin="00:23.338" end="00:29.448" itunes:key="L29744">同じ場所で 同じ目線のまま<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在同一个地方 用同样的目光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o na ji ba sho de o na ji me se n no ma ma</span></p><p begin="00:29.458" end="00:34.691" itunes:key="L29745">傾かないように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只为了不要偏移</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ta mu ka na i yo u ni</span></p><p begin="00:34.701" end="00:39.711" itunes:key="L29746">釣り合う重さで預けたいから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要把相称的重量托付对方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu ri a u o mo sa de a zu ke ta i ka ra</span></p><p begin="00:39.721" end="00:45.198" itunes:key="L29747">背負うだけの存在じゃなくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不只是简单的背负</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se o u da ke no so n za i ja na ku te</span></p><p begin="00:45.208" end="00:50.450" itunes:key="L29748">背中合わせの僕らのLEVEL<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而是你我脊背相依的level</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se na ka a wa se no bo ku ra no level</span></p><p begin="00:50.460" end="00:56.380" itunes:key="L29749">息するリズムさえ揃えて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连呼吸的节奏都趋向同步</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ki su ru ri zu mu sa e so ro e te</span></p><p begin="00:56.822" end="01:00.030" itunes:key="L29750">振り向かずに結んだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不再回头 紧紧相连</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ri mu ka zu ni mu su n da</span></p><p begin="01:00.040" end="01:04.321" itunes:key="L29751">この鼓動が指切りがわり<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让这心跳代替拉钩的手指</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ko do u ga yu bi ki ri ga wa ri</span></p><p begin="01:04.331" end="01:09.228" itunes:key="L29752">いつだって伝わっているから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">随时都能传到你我心间</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu da 't te tsu ta wa 't te i ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:18.695" end="01:21.557" itunes:key="L29753">遠ざかる日々見つめて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">注视着那些远去的时光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to o za ka ru hi bi mi tsu me te</span></p><p begin="01:21.567" end="01:24.130" itunes:key="L29754">変わらないでと祈った<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">祈祷可以永远不要改变</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka wa ra na i de to i no 't ta</span></p><p begin="01:24.140" end="01:28.940" itunes:key="L29755">小さな自分が影を落とす<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">弱小的自己落下了阴影</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chi i sa na ji bu n ga ka ge wo o to su</span></p><p begin="01:29.517" end="01:32.160" itunes:key="L29756">照らされた輪郭は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被光所照耀到的轮廓</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te ra sa re ta ri n ka ku wa</span></p><p begin="01:32.270" end="01:35.016" itunes:key="L29757">光に溶けてしまいそう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仿佛就要消融于其中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ka ri ni to ke te shi ma i so u</span></p><p begin="01:35.026" end="01:39.380" itunes:key="L29758">どんな言葉なら触れられるだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">要用怎样的言语 才能够触及</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do n na ko to ba na ra fu re ra re ru da ro u</span></p><p begin="01:39.565" end="01:42.634" itunes:key="L29759">君の過去を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的过去 你的未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no ka ko wo ki mi no mi ra i wo</span></p><p begin="01:42.644" end="01:44.980" itunes:key="L29760">君の未来を</p><p begin="01:44.990" end="01:50.303" itunes:key="L29761">留めてしまわないように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了再也不会有任何阻碍</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to me te shi ma wa na i yo u ni</span></p><p begin="01:50.643" end="01:55.795" itunes:key="L29762">失うくらいなら全部捨てて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与其失去不如将一切舍弃</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u shi na u ku ra i na ra ze n bu su te te</span></p><p begin="01:55.805" end="02:01.549" itunes:key="L29763">ゼロから今を作りたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从零开始创造我们的现在</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ze ro ka ra i ma wo tsu ku ri ta i</span></p><p begin="02:01.559" end="02:06.560" itunes:key="L29764">荒唐無稽な僕らのSAGAS<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">寻找着荒唐无稽的我们</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko u to u mu ke i na bo ku ra wo sa ga su</span></p><p begin="02:06.570" end="02:12.393" itunes:key="L29765">世界がそう呼ぶとしても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算世界在狂风中动荡</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se ka i ga so yo gu to shi te mo</span></p><p begin="02:12.403" end="02:15.672" itunes:key="L29766">本当の話なら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那些真心的话语</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho n to u no ha na shi na ra</span></p><p begin="02:15.682" end="02:20.251" itunes:key="L29767">二人だけが知っていればいい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要我们两人知道就好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ta ri da ke ga shi 't te i re ba i i</span></p><p begin="02:20.261" end="02:27.639" itunes:key="L29768">大切なことはそれだけさ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那便是唯一重要的事情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta i se tsu na ko to wa so re da ke sa</span></p><p begin="02:34.537" end="02:37.363" itunes:key="L29769">落とした影を包んだのは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将我投下的阴影所包裹的是</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o to shi ta ka ge wo tsu tsu n da no wa</span></p><p begin="02:37.373" end="02:39.757" itunes:key="L29770">堆い時間のベール<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那些笨拙的时间所编织的帷幕</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu ta na i ji ka n no be e ru</span></p><p begin="02:40.067" end="02:44.994" itunes:key="L29771">繰り返し繋いだ日々<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是那一直连结着彼此心灵的日夜</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku ri ka e shi tsu na i da hi bi</span></p><p begin="02:45.304" end="02:50.035" itunes:key="L29772">釣り合う重さで預けたいから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要把相称的重量托付对方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu ri a u o mo sa de a zu ke ta i ka ra</span></p><p begin="02:50.045" end="02:55.627" itunes:key="L29773">背負うだけの存在じゃなくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不只是简单的背负</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se o u da ke no so n za i ja na ku te</span></p><p begin="02:55.637" end="03:00.566" itunes:key="L29774">背中合わせの僕らのLEVEL<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而是你我脊背相依的level</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se na ka a wa se no bo ku ra no level</span></p><p begin="03:00.576" end="03:06.252" itunes:key="L29775">息するリズムさえ揃えて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连呼吸的节奏都趋向同步</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ki su ru ri zu mu sa e so ro e te</span></p><p begin="03:06.462" end="03:11.780" itunes:key="L29776">揺れる音が名前を呼ぶように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">颤抖的声音呼唤着彼此的名字</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu re ru o to ga na ma e wo yo bu yo u ni</span></p><p begin="03:11.790" end="03:17.323" itunes:key="L29777">もっともっと互いを求める<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">更加的更加的渴求着彼此</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo 't to mo 't to ta ga i wo mo to me ru</span></p><p begin="03:17.333" end="03:22.292" itunes:key="L29778">背中合わせの僕らのLEVEL<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你我脊背相依的level</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se na ka a wa se no bo ku ra no level</span></p><p begin="03:22.302" end="03:28.094" itunes:key="L29779">ずっとずっと聞こえていたよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一直都能听见那道声音</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to zu 't to ki ko e te i ta yo</span></p><p begin="03:28.707" end="03:31.582" itunes:key="L29780">振り向かずに結んだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不再回头 紧紧相连</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ri mu ka zu ni mu su n da</span></p><p begin="03:31.592" end="03:36.163" itunes:key="L29781">この鼓動が指切りがわり<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让这心跳代替拉钩的手指</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ko do u ga yu bi ki ri ga wa ri</span></p><p begin="03:36.173" end="03:42.414" itunes:key="L29782">いつだって伝わっているから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">随时都能传到你我心间</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu da 't te tsu ta wa 't te i ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="03:51.409" end="03:56.326" itunes:key="L29783">伝わっているから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">传到你我心间</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu ta wa 't te i ru ka ra</span></p></div></body></tt>